    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smith & Butler Estates are delighted to present 28 Shanliss Way to the market. This spacious four-bedroom, four-bathroom semi-detached family home is ideally positioned on this established residential road in Santry. The property has been extended to the rear and benefits from a converted attic with en-suite, providing generous and versatile accommodation over three floors.\r\n\r\nOn entering, there is an enclosed porch leading to a welcoming hallway with semi-solid timber flooring and useful under-stair storage. To the front is a generous living room with feature fireplace, large picture window and fitted shelving.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, the property has been extended to create an impressive kitchen and dining/family space. The extensive fitted kitchen features ample oak units with granite counter tops and an island, while the bright vaulted dining area provides plenty of space for family living and entertaining, with patio doors opening onto the rear garden. A utility area and guest WC complete the ground floor.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are four bedrooms including a spacious primary bedroom with wall-to-wall fitted wardrobes. The rear double bedroom overlooks the garden, while the single bedroom to the front is ideally suited as a child's bedroom or home office. The first floor also features a family bathroom and a separate shower room.\r\n\r\nThe converted attic provides an excellent additional space with various uses such as home office/playroom, together with a an en-suite containing a , W.C. and roof windows providing plenty of natural light.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property benefits from a gated front garden with a paved driveway providing off-street parking. To the rear is a long, private and fully enclosed garden with lawn, raised patio and mature planting. A detached block-built workshop with power and separate access provides useful additional storage or hobby space.\r\n\r\nThe property is conveniently located close to a wide range of amenities in Santry, including local shops, schools, parks, sports facilities and Dublin City University. There are excellent transport links nearby, with easy access to the M1, M50 and Dublin Airport, while Dublin city centre is also readily accessible by public transport."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch - 1.63m (5'4\") x 1.06m (3'6\")\r\nEnclosed entrance porch with glazed door and tiled floor leading to the main hallway.\r\n\r\nHall - 1.63m (5'4\") x 5.81m (19'1\")\r\nWelcoming hallway with semi-solid timber flooring, under-stair storage and carpeted stairs to upper floors.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 3.81m (12'6\") x 5.82m (19'1\")\r\nGenerous front reception with feature fireplace, large picture window and fitted shelving, ideal for family relaxation.\r\n\r\nBath (Ground Floor) - 0.81m (2'8\") x 1.18m (3'10\")\r\nConvenient guest WC off the hall with tiled floor and W.H.B..\r\n\r\nKitchen - 5.54m (18'2\") x 5.57m (18'3\")\r\nExtensive fitted kitchen with Granite work tops, ample oak wall and floor units, island, tiled flooring and back-splash, appliances including gas hob, oven, grill, microwave, extractor fan, fridge/freezer and opening to the rear extension.\r\n\r\nDining Area - 5.54m (18'2\") x 3.52m (11'7\")\r\nSuperb vaulted dining and family space with multiple ceiling lights, patio doors to the terrace and views over the rear garden.\r\n\r\nHall (First Floor) - 2.75m (9'0\") x 6.3m (20'8\")\r\nBright landing with red carpet, window to side and access to bedrooms and main bathroom.\r\n\r\nPrimary Bedroom - 3.31m (10'10\") x 3.72m (12'2\")\r\nSpacious principal bedroom with wall-to-wall fitted wardrobes and wide window overlooking the front.\r\n\r\nMaster en-suite - 1.41m (10'10\") x 3.72m (12'2\")\r\nWith tiled flooring, Shower unit, W.C. & W.H.B..\r\n\r\nBedroom (Rear) - 3.3m (10'10\") x 2.9m (9'6\")\r\nRear double bedroom with timber flooring and garden outlook, ideal as a guest or children`s room.\r\n\r\nBedroom (Front Small) - 2.13m (7'0\") x 2.17m (7'1\")\r\nVersatile room suited to a home office or nursery, with timber flooring and front aspect window.\r\n\r\nBath (Main) - 2.46m (8'1\") x 1.41m (4'8\")\r\nFully tiled family bathroom with bath, separate corner shower, WC and bidet, finished with modern sanitaryware.\r\n\r\nBath (First Floor Rear) - 2.17m (7'1\") x 3.02m (9'11\")\r\nAdditional shower room with tiled walls and flooring, serving the rear bedroom.\r\n\r\nStorage - 2m (6'7\") x 2m (6'7\")\r\nHandy built-in storage cupboard located off the landing.\r\n\r\nHall (Second Floor) - 1.63m (5'4\") x 1.87m (6'2\")\r\nLanding to attic conversion with access to shower room and roof windows providing natural light.\r\n\r\nAttic Room - 4.3m (14'1\") x 4.07m (13'4\")\r\nBright converted attic offering an excellent additional bedroom or studio space with timber flooring and radiator.\r\n\r\nBath (Second Floor) - 0.81m (2'8\") x 1.7m (5'7\")\r\nTiled attic shower room with WC & W.H.B..\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\nCompact utility off the kitchen with plumbing for washing machine, ventilated for drier and shelving.\r\n\r\nWorkshop/Outbuilding\r\nDetached block-built workshop to rear with power and separate access, ideal for storage or hobbies.\r\n\r\nRear Garden\r\nLong, private garden with lawn, concrete path, raised patio, side access and mature planting with a detached outbuilding.\r\n\r\nFront Garden and Drive\r\nGated low-maintenance front garden with paved drive providing off-street parking and planting.\r\n\r\nExternally: To the front, the property benefits from a gated, low-maintenance garden with a paved driveway providing off-street parking. To the rear is a long west facing garden, private and fully enclosed garden with a lawn, raised patio area and mature planting. A detached outbuilding with electricity and plumbing for water provides excellent additional storage and could be used as a workshop, hobby space or home office,\r\n\r\nTotal floor measurement: 174 Sq.M / 1873 ft²  approx"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Double extension to the rear\r\nAttic conversion with en-suite\r\nChain free sale\r\nBlock built garden studio with power and plumbing supplies\r\nGated driveway & shared side passage\r\nInsulated\r\nUtility room\r\nMaster en-suite\r\nKitchen island with granite counter tops\r\nGas central heating (new boiler)\r\nWest facing garden\r\nGuest W.C.\r\nBright open plan kitchen with island\r\nFeature fireplace\r\nFitted wardrobes\r\nFour double bedrooms\r\nStorm porch\r\nClose to bus and M50\r\nLocal  amenities nearby"
      },
